#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:10
#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:9
msgid "Slack Migration"
msgstr "Slack 마이그레이션"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:44
#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:95
msgid "Time For An Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드할 시간입니다"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:47
msgid "Well, look who has private channels with alert rules."
msgstr "알림 규칙이 설정된 비공개 채널이 있군요."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:49
msgid ""
"\n"
"                So what does this mean for you and the future of your channels? Not much.\n"
"                You'll just need to add the Sentry bot to each channel after you authorize the new Slack app.\n"
"                Otherwise, you might miss out on some important error alerts.\n"
"                "
msgstr "\n                그렇다면 사용자와 채널에 어떤 변화가 생길까요? 큰 변화는 없습니다.\n                새 Slack 앱을 승인한 후 각 채널에 Sentry 봇을 추가하기만 하면 됩니다.\n                그렇지 않으면 중요한 오류 알림을 놓칠 수 있습니다.\n                "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:59
msgid ""
"\n"
"                No need to waste time committing these to memory. After you authenticate the app,\n"
"                we'll give you one last nudge via your private channels.\n"
"                "
msgstr "\n                이 내용을 외우느라 시간을 낭비할 필요는 없습니다. 앱을 인증한 후\n                비공개 채널을 통해 마지막으로 한 번 더 알려드리겠습니다.\n                "

#: static/app/components/onboarding/gettingStartedDoc/onboardingLayout.tsx:97
#: static/app/components/onboardingWizard/sidebar.tsx:51
#: static/app/views/onboarding/setupDocsLoader.tsx:212
#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:66
#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:77
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "다음 단계"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:68
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Click <strong>Upgrade</strong> to start the authentication flow for the new Slack app.\n"
"            "
msgstr "\n            <strong>업그레이드</strong>를 클릭하여 새 Slack 앱의 인증 절차를 시작하세요.\n            "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:79
msgid ""
"\n"
"                See, that wasn't so bad. Just click <strong>Upgrade</strong> to start the authentication flow for the new Slack app.\n"
"                "
msgstr "\n                보셨죠? 그리 어렵지 않았습니다. <strong>업그레이드</strong>를 클릭하여 새 Slack 앱의 인증 절차를 시작하세요.\n                "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:89
#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:149
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Have questions? Emails us at <a href=\"mailto:partners@sentry.io?subject=Slack Upgrade\"><strong>partners@sentry.io</strong></a>\n"
"                "
msgstr "\n                궁금한 점이 있나요? <a href=\"mailto:partners@sentry.io?subject=Slack Upgrade\"><strong>partners@sentry.io</strong></a>로 이메일을 보내주세요.\n                "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-details.html:94
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:97
msgid "Farewell to Slack's legacy workspace apps."
msgstr "Slack의 기존 워크스페이스 앱과 작별할 시간입니다."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:99
msgid ""
"The time has come, Slack's deprecated its workspace apps. And with it, goes "
"our legacy Slack integration."
msgstr "Slack이 워크스페이스 앱 지원을 중단했습니다. 이에 따라 기존 Slack 연동도 종료됩니다."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:102
msgid ""
"But don't worry, we built you a whole new Sentry-Slack integration. Just "
"authorize the app, and then you can get back to doing whatever it is you "
"came here to do."
msgstr "걱정하지 마세요. 완전히 새로운 Sentry-Slack 연동을 준비했습니다. 앱을 승인한 후 원래 하려던 작업으로 돌아가면 됩니다."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:105
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Want to know more about the move? We wrote you some <a href=\"https://docs.sentry.io/product/integrations/slack/#upgrading-slack\">docs</a>.\n"
"        "
msgstr "\n        이전에 관해 더 알고 싶으신가요? 관련 <a href=\"https://docs.sentry.io/product/integrations/slack/#upgrading-slack\">문서</a>를 준비했습니다.\n        "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:110
msgid "Your existing alert rules may need some love."
msgstr "기존 알림 규칙을 조금 손봐야 할 수 있습니다."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:112
msgid ""
"If you don't have private channels in your alert rules, just authorize our "
"new Slack app and then you can get on with your life."
msgstr "알림 규칙에 비공개 채널이 없다면 새 Slack 앱을 승인한 후 평소처럼 사용하면 됩니다."

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:115
msgid ""
"\n"
"        If you <strong>do</strong> have private channels being used in your alert rules, bear with us. You've got an extra step to go.\n"
"        "
msgstr "\n        알림 규칙에서 비공개 채널을 <strong>사용하고 있다면</strong> 잠시만 기다려 주세요. 한 단계가 더 남았습니다.\n        "

#: templates/sentry/integrations/slack/reauth-introduction.html:120
msgid ""
"\n"
