#: static/app/components/assistant/getGuidesContent.tsx:34
msgid "Retrace Your Steps"
msgstr "단계 되짚기"

#: static/app/components/assistant/getGuidesContent.tsx:36
msgid ""
"Not sure how you got here? Sentry automatically captures breadcrumbs for\n"
"              events your user and app took that led to the error."
msgstr "어떻게 여기까지 왔는지 모르시겠나요? Sentry는 오류로 이어진 사용자와 앱의\n              이벤트 브레드크럼을 자동으로 수집합니다."

#: static/app/components/assistant/getGuidesContent.tsx:39
msgid "Annoy the Right People"
msgstr "적절한 담당자에게 알리기"

#: static/app/components/assistant/getGuidesContent.tsx:41
msgid ""
"Automatically assign issues to the person who introduced the commit,\n"
"              notify them over notification tools like Slack,\n"
"              and triage through issue management tools like Jira. "
msgstr "커밋을 만든 사람에게 이슈를 자동으로 할당하고,\n              Slack 같은 알림 도구로 담당자에게 알린 다음,\n              Jira 같은 이슈 관리 도구로 분류하세요. "

#: static/app/components/assistant/getGuidesContent.tsx:51
msgid ""
"Sentry automatically groups similar events together into an issue. Similarity is\n"
"            determined by stack trace and other factors. [link:Learn more]."
