#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:10
msgid ""
"The <code>connect-src</code> directive defines valid sources for fetch,\n"
"  <code>XMLHttpRequest</code>, <code>WebSocket</code>, and\n"
"  <code>EventSource</code> connections."
msgstr "<code>connect-src</code> 지시문은 fetch,\n  <code>XMLHttpRequest</code>, <code>WebSocket</code> 및\n  <code>EventSource</code> 연결에 유효한 소스를 정의합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:13
msgid ""
"The <code>font-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for fonts\n"
"  loaded using <code>@font-face</code>."
msgstr "<code>font-src</code> 지시문은 <code>@font-face</code>를 사용하여\n  불러오는 글꼴의 유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:15
msgid ""
"The <code>form-action</code> directive specifies valid endpoints for\n"
"  <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> submissions."
msgstr "<code>form-action</code> 지시문은 <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>\n  제출에 유효한 엔드포인트를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:17
msgid ""
"The <code>frame-ancestors</code> directive specifies valid parents that\n"
"  may embed a page using the <code>&lt;frame&gt;</code> and\n"
"  <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> elements."
msgstr "<code>frame-ancestors</code> 지시문은 <code>&lt;frame&gt;</code> 및\n  <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> 요소로 페이지를 삽입할 수 있는\n  유효한 상위 항목을 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:20
msgid ""
"The <code>img-src</code> directive specifies valid sources of images and\n"
"  favicons."
msgstr "<code>img-src</code> 지시문은 이미지와\n  파비콘의 유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:22
msgid ""
"The <code>prefetch-src</code> directive restricts the URLs\n"
"      from which resources may be prefetched or prerendered."
msgstr "<code>prefetch-src</code> 지시문은 리소스를 미리 가져오거나\n      사전 렌더링할 수 있는 URL을 제한합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:24
msgid ""
"The <code>manifest-src</code> directive specifies which manifest can be\n"
"  applied to the resource."
msgstr "<code>manifest-src</code> 지시문은 리소스에\n  적용할 수 있는 매니페스트를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:26
msgid ""
"The <code>media-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for loading\n"
"  media using the <code>&lt;audio&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>\n"
"  elements."
msgstr "<code>media-src</code> 지시문은 <code>&lt;audio&gt;</code> 및 <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>\n  요소로 미디어를 불러올 수 있는 유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:29
msgid ""
"The <code>object-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for the\n"
"  <code>&lt;object&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;embed&gt;</code>, and\n"
"  <code>&lt;applet&gt;</code> elements."
msgstr "<code>object-src</code> 지시문은 <code>&lt;object&gt;</code>,\n  <code>&lt;embed&gt;</code> 및 <code>&lt;applet&gt;</code> 요소의\n  유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:3
msgid ""
"The <code>base-uri</code> directive defines the URIs that a user agent\n"
"  may use as the document base URL. If this value is absent, then any URI\n"
"  is allowed. If this directive is absent, the user agent will use the\n"
"  value in the <code>&lt;base&gt;</code> element."
msgstr "<code>base-uri</code> 지시문은 사용자 에이전트가 문서의 기본 URL로\n  사용할 수 있는 URI를 정의합니다. 값이 없으면 모든 URI가 허용됩니다.\n  이 지시문이 없으면 사용자 에이전트는 <code>&lt;base&gt;</code>\n  요소의 값을 사용합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:32
msgid ""
"The <code>plugin-types</code> directive specifies the valid plugins that\n"
"  the user agent may invoke."
msgstr "<code>plugin-types</code> 지시문은 사용자 에이전트가\n  실행할 수 있는 유효한 플러그인을 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:34
msgid ""
"The <code>referrer</code> directive specifies information in the\n"
"  <code>Referer</code> header for links away from a page."
msgstr "<code>referrer</code> 지시문은 페이지 외부 링크의\n  <code>Referer</code> 헤더 정보를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:36
msgid ""
"The <code>script-src</code> directive specifies valid sources\n"
"  for JavaScript. When either the <code>script-src</code> or the\n"
"  <code>default-src</code> directive is included, inline script and\n"
"  <code>eval()</code> are disabled unless you specify 'unsafe-inline'\n"
"  and 'unsafe-eval', respectively."
msgstr "<code>script-src</code> 지시문은 JavaScript의 유효한 소스를\n  지정합니다. <code>script-src</code> 또는 <code>default-src</code> 지시문이\n  포함되면 각각 'unsafe-inline'과 'unsafe-eval'을 지정하지 않는 한 인라인 스크립트와\n  <code>eval()</code>이 비활성화됩니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:41
msgid ""
"The <code>script-src-elem</code> directive applies to all script requests\n"
"      and element contents. It does not apply to scripts defined in attributes."
msgstr "<code>script-src-elem</code> 지시문은 모든 스크립트 요청과\n      요소 콘텐츠에 적용되며 속성에 정의된 스크립트에는 적용되지 않습니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:43
msgid ""
"The <code>script-src-attr</code> directive applies to event handlers and, if present,\n"
"      it will override the <code>script-src</code> directive for relevant checks."
msgstr "<code>script-src-attr</code> 지시문은 이벤트 처리기에 적용되며, 존재하는 경우\n      관련 검사에서 <code>script-src</code> 지시문을 재정의합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:45
msgid ""
"The <code>style-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for\n"
"  stylesheets. This includes both externally-loaded stylesheets and inline\n"
"  use of the <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> element and HTML style attributes.\n"
"  Stylesheets from sources that aren't included in the source list are not\n"
"  requested or loaded. When either the <code>style-src</code> or the\n"
"  <code>default-src</code> directive is included, inline use of the\n"
"  <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> element and HTML style attributes are disabled\n"
"  unless you specify 'unsafe-inline'."
msgstr "<code>style-src</code> 지시문은 스타일시트의 유효한 소스를 지정합니다.\n  외부 스타일시트와 <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> 요소 및 HTML 스타일 속성의\n  인라인 사용이 포함됩니다. 소스 목록에 없는 스타일시트는 요청하거나\n  불러오지 않습니다. <code>style-src</code> 또는 <code>default-src</code> 지시문이\n  포함되면 'unsafe-inline'을 지정하지 않는 한 <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> 요소와\n  HTML 스타일 속성의 인라인 사용이 비활성화됩니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:53
msgid ""
"The <code>style-src-elem</code> directive applies to all styles except\n"
"      those defined in inline attributes."
msgstr "<code>style-src-elem</code> 지시문은 인라인 속성에\n      정의된 스타일을 제외한 모든 스타일에 적용됩니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:55
msgid ""
"The <code>style-src-attr</code> directive applies to inline style attributes and, if present,\n"
"      it will override the <code>style-src</code> directive for relevant checks."
msgstr "<code>style-src-attr</code> 지시문은 인라인 스타일 속성에 적용되며, 존재하는 경우\n      관련 검사에서 <code>style-src</code> 지시문을 재정의합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:57
msgid ""
"The <code>frame-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for nested\n"
"  browsing contexts loading using elements such as\n"
"  <code>&lt;frame&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>."
msgstr "<code>frame-src</code> 지시문은 <code>&lt;frame&gt;</code> 및\n  <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> 같은 요소로 불러오는 중첩 브라우징 컨텍스트의\n  유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:60
msgid ""
"The <code>worker-src</code> directive specifies valid sources for\n"
"  <code>Worker<code>, <code>SharedWorker</code>, or\n"
"  <code>ServiceWorker</code> scripts."
msgstr "<code>worker-src</code> 지시문은 <code>Worker<code>, <code>SharedWorker</code> 또는\n  <code>ServiceWorker</code> 스크립트의 유효한 소스를 지정합니다."

#: static/app/components/events/interfaces/csp/help/effectiveDirectives.tsx:7
msgid ""
