#: static/app/components/onboarding/gettingStartedDoc/utils/feedbackOnboarding.tsx:12
msgid ""
"To set up the integration, add the following to your Sentry initialization. "
"There are many options you can pass to the [code:integrations] constructor "
"to customize your form. [break] [break] You can even [linkButton:link the "
