"The maximum monitor limit for this project has been reached. Please reach "
"out to our [link:sales team] to create additional monitors."
msgstr "이 프로젝트의 최대 모니터 한도에 도달했습니다. 모니터를 추가하려면 [link:영업팀]에 문의하세요."

#: static/app/views/monitors/components/processingErrors/processingErrorItem.tsx:65
